          %h3#in_perturbative_quantum_field_theory In perturbative quantum field theory
          %p
            Feynman graphs play a central role in
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/perturbative+quantum+field+theory"} perturbative quantum field theory
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi exp
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mi I
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %msub
                    %mi μ
                    %mi S
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \exp(I)\mu_S
            plays the role of an
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/action+functional"} action functional
            on a space of
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/field+%28physics%29"} fields
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
